    {
      "id": "review-cb0dcbefc63c-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-fail-closed",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1082：接受确认后再次 await projectBatchPlan，但返回后直到 registry.issue/startBatch 都没有检查 cancellation；用户在这次远程查询期间取消，仍会创建分支、持久化 batch 并可能 enroll。应在最后一次异步重验证之后、发行 authority 和启动之前检查 signal，并返回 cancelled；增加该时间窗口的零写入测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-cb0dcbefc63c-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-gate",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1127：授权使用 plan.enrollable，却向 startBatch 传入未经依赖归一化的 plan.children。直接调用所需的未修改文件 runtime/unattended/batch_plan.ts 会从 enrollable.blocked_by 排除 already_settled 依赖，而 runtime/unattended/batch_runner.ts 的 validateRunAuthorization 会重新计算输入 children 的摘要；因此合法的已完成前置任务加待执行后继任务会产生摘要不匹配，无法启动。应保留显示元数据但使用 plan.enrollable 的规范依赖构造 runner children，并覆盖已完成前置任务场景。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-cb0dcbefc63c-3-review-3",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-fail-closed",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1149：无论 startBatch 返回什么 report，均返回 state: started。直接调用所需的未修改 runtime/unattended/batch_runner.ts 明确在最终 branch preflight 或 authorization 校验失败时返回 batch_state: rejected；例如确认期间分支被创建、工作树变脏或授权过期，本接口仍宣告启动且没有顶层 rejection reason/recovery_action。应将 rejected report 映射为 rejected 和一个同 Host 恢复动作，并增加确认后 preflight 失败测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-cb0dcbefc63c-4-review-4",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-fail-closed",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1001：新的 batch gate 直接等待 requestConfirmation，没有超时边界；其实际调用链 plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts:434 的 await response 也没有 timer，未知或旧 requestId 的回复只被忽略。因此连接保持打开但 elicitation 证据缺失或仅被重放时，请求永久 pending，不会产生要求的稳定拒绝结果，expires_at 也不会终止等待。应为 batch elicitation 增加有界超时、清理 pending 并返回 rejected，保留旧 privileged operations 行为，补充 wire 级超时和仅重放证据测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-abaffb4a195a-1-review-batch-enrollment-context",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-gate",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1247 构造 enrollment input 时遗漏 batch context，随后在第 1260 行调用 enrollCanaryTask。Kernel 因而跳过 batch 专属的 HEAD lineage 检查和与 TaskRecord 写入同锁的 consumeChild；真实 enrollment 成功后，适配器第 1275 行的 ownsTaskClaim 仍返回 false，恢复流程会把本批次自己的活跃 claim 判为 foreign。请将 registry、capability、完整 binding 和 expected_head 通过 input.batch 传入既有 Kernel enrollment，并增加不替换 enrollTask 的真实 enrollment/ownership 回归覆盖。现有成功测试 mock 了 enrollment，无法发现此缺口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-abaffb4a195a-2-review-batch-active-claim-race",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-fail-closed",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1116 在最后一次 workspace/backend claim 检查之后 await projectBatchPlan，恢复执行后只检查 digest 和 cancellation，直接 issue 并调用 startBatch。第二次 Initiative 读取期间另一个请求可以完成 enrollment；只要计划未变，本请求仍继续。startBatch 在 child enrollment 检查之前执行建分支 preflight 并持久化 running 状态，因此会在已有 active claim 的情况下创建 Git ref 和 batch state，违反零写入契约。请在异步重验证完成后重新检查 claim，并由 Kernel 在首次副作用边界保证 claim 检查与启动互斥；补充第二次 readInitiative 期间出现 active claim 的回归测试，断言 blocked 且无新增 ref 或 batch state。"
    },
