    {
      "id": "review-a488a4792a01-1-review-batch-head-revalidation-window",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-fail-closed",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 3,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1116：最后一次 HEAD 校验发生在异步 projectBatchPlan 重读之前，重读之后只复查 claim 和取消信号。如果此时另一个操作提交了不改变 child intent 的内容，plan_digest 仍相同，授权会继续签发。随后 runBatchGitPreflight 仅检查 HEAD 存在，不检查它等于 base_head，并执行 checkout -b <branch> <旧 base_head>，因此创建新 ref、切回旧快照并写入 batch state，而不是拒绝确认期间发生的工作区变化。最小修复：在异步重读完成后、签发授权前再次验证 HEAD；增加第二次 readInitiative 期间推进 HEAD 的回归用例，断言拒绝且不新增 ref 或 batch state。"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-a488a4792a01-2-review-batch-partial-port-fabricates-enrollment",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-claude-batch-gate",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 3,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:1237：提供任何 batchKernel 局部覆盖都会令未覆盖的 enrollTask 返回伪造的 record_revision=\\\"r\\\"，未覆盖的 advanceTask 直接返回 completed，ownsTaskClaim 默认返回 true，而不是复用真实 Kernel 实现。tests/claude-batch-authority.test.ts:722 声称验证真实 enrollment 和 child slot 消耗，但正好进入此分支，实际没有调用 deriveChildEnrollment 或 enrollCanaryTask；其 completed 断言无法证明关键授权契约。最小修复：先构建真实默认 port，再仅覆盖显式提供的方法，删除隐式成功替身；更新该测试，实际断言 Kernel enrollment、slot 消耗及每次确认只签发一次 Batch Authorization。"
    },
